Mark: *giggles*

00:10:56.300 --> 00:10:59.960
Wade:  So, if you leave the camper, go to the right and just hug that right wall

00:10:59.960 --> 00:11:02.080
Bob: --my god, what IS that?

00:11:02.080 --> 00:11:04.560
