00:11:08.300 --> 00:11:10.080
Mark: *tiny laugh* 
(Bob: What IS that?)

00:11:10.080 --> 00:11:11.020
Wade: I dunno

00:11:11.020 --> 00:11:12.240
Rake:  *screeches* 
