Mark: Ooh

00:11:27.060 --> 00:11:28.460
Wade: I definitely had no idea that that would happen--

00:11:28.460 --> 00:11:30.460
[Rake screeches]
Bob:  OH GOD fuckin' shit!

00:11:30.460 --> 00:11:31.840
Wade: *laughs*
Bob: Jesus Christ!

00:11:31.840 --> 00:11:33.780
