00:13:51.300 --> 00:13:53.460
Mark:  I wanna kill him... oh wow

00:13:53.460 --> 00:13:56.200
Bob &amp; Mark:  *cracking up*

00:13:56.200 --> 00:13:58.200
Bob:  *losing it*

00:14:01.080 --> 00:14:02.940
Mark:  Ooooohh wow

