00:14:48.580 --> 00:14:50.580
Mark:  WOOOOOOO!!!!

00:14:50.620 --> 00:14:54.140
Bob:  *laughing* 
Mark:  Yaaaaaay!

00:14:54.300 --> 00:14:57.260
Wade:  Oohh my goodness
Mark:  What a game

00:14:57.560 --> 00:15:00.280
