00:15:24.860 --> 00:15:27.980
Bob:  *laughs*
Mark:  *inhales deeply*  Mmmmmm

00:15:27.980 --> 00:15:29.760
Bob:  Oh my gosh
Mark:  Oh, well...

00:15:29.760 --> 00:15:32.520
